msgctxt "188_Chigusa"
msgid "Well? You ready?"
msgstr "¿Y? ¿Estás listo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Chigusa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. Go with Chigusa -> T1.P7 | 2. Take a Rain Check -> T1.P2
msgctxt "200_Chigusa"
msgid "Just come with me and I'll make you remember everything."
msgstr "Ven conmigo y te haré recordar todo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Kiryu"
msgid "Look, I'm sorry... but whoever you're looking for, I'm not\\r\nhim."
msgstr "Mira, lo siento... pero a quienquiera que sea que estás\\r \nbuscando, no soy yo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Chigusa"
msgid "You can keep saying that until your face turns blue, but I'm\\r\nsure I can make you remember! How long are you gonna keep pretending!?"
msgstr "¡Puedes seguir repitiendo eso hasta que los cerdos vuelen,\\r \npero estoy segura que te puedo hacer recordar! ¿¡Vas a\\r \nseguir fingiendo!?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Take a Rain Check
msgctxt "236_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Chigusa"
msgid "Ugh, fine! I'll just wait here until you've come to your\\r\nsenses. Crawl back to me once you're ready to face the\\r\nmusic."
msgstr "¡Ugh, está bien! Esperaré aquí hasta que entres en razón.\\r \nVuelve a rastras hasta aquí cuando estés listo para \\r \nenfrentarte a la dura realidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Take a Rain Check
msgctxt "260_Kiryu"
msgid "(Hm... I don't know what it is, but something's definitely up with this girl. Maybe it wouldn't hurt to hear her out when I have the time.)"
msgstr "(Hm... no sé que pasa, pero hay algo raro en esta chica. \\r \nPuede que escuche lo que le pasa cuando tenga tiempo.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Go with Chigusa
msgctxt "272_Kiryu"
msgid "All right, I guess I can spare some time."
msgstr "Bueno. Supongo que tengo algo de tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Chigusa"
msgid "Why didn't you say so in the first place? Ugh, whatever.\\r\nLet's start over at Mach Bowl. You must remember Mach Bowl,\\r\nright?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no lo dijiste antes? Ugh, como sea. \\r \nVamos primero al Mach Bowl.\\r\n¿Te acordarás de Mach Bowl, no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Kiryu"
msgid "I know it, yeah, but－"
msgstr "Sí, lo conozco, pero -"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Chigusa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Go with Chigusa
msgctxt "308_Chigusa"
msgid "Then let's go!"
msgstr "¡Entonces vamos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Chigusa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Go with Chigusa
msgctxt "320_Chigusa"
msgid "Come on."
msgstr "Bueno, a buscar se ha dicho..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Chigusa"
msgid "You could have at least called me when you got back to town!\\r\nBut no, all you ever think about is yourself!"
msgstr "¡Al menos podrías haberme llamado al volver a la ciudad!\\r \nPero no, ¡solo piensas en ti mismo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Chigusa"
msgid "There's only so much bullshit one girl can take! I give and\\r\ngive and give, and all I get back is <Italic>lies</Italic>! Well, no more!"
msgstr "¡Una tiene un límite de mentiras de mierda que soporta! Yo\\r \ndoy y doy, y todo lo que recibo son <Italic>mentiras</Italic>! ¡Se acabó!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Kiryu"
msgid "I think you've got the wrong guy. I don't even know who you\\r\nare."
msgstr "Creo que te has equivocado de hombre. No se ni \\r \nquién eres."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Chigusa"
msgid "Chigusa Yachiyo! Are you seriously pretending you don't\\r\nremember me!? How low are you gonna stoop!?"
msgstr "¡Chigusa Yachiyo! ¿¡En serio estás fingiendo no recordarme!?\\r \n¿¡Cuán bajo vas a caer!?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "392_Kiryu"
msgid "How could I remember you when we've never met?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te voy a recordar si nunca nos hemos conocido?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Chigusa"
msgid "You're kidding, right? You promised me you'd come back to\\r\nKamurocho, and we could be together again. I waited for you\\r\nall this time, and look what I got!"
msgstr "¿Bromeas, verdad? Me prometiste que volverías a Kamurocho\\r \ny que estaríamos juntos de nuevo. ¡Te esperé todo este\\r \ntiempo para esto!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "416_Kiryu"
msgid "I did... what?"
msgstr "Que yo hice... ¿qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Chigusa"
msgid "Don't tell me that was another one of your lies. Where have\\r\nyou been this past year, anyway?"
msgstr "No me digas que esa era otra de tus mentiras. ¿Dónde has \\r \nestado este último año, eh?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Kiryu"
msgid "Look, I honestly don't know who you are, but maybe I can\\r\nhelp you find the guy you're looking for. What's his name?\\r\nI'm Kiryu, by the way."
msgstr "Mira, te prometo que no sé quien eres, pero te puedo ayudar\\r \na encontrar al hombre que estás buscando. ¿Cómo se llama?\\r \nYo soy Kiryu, por cierto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Chigusa"
msgid "*sigh* So you're going by a different name now? Do you\\r\nreally want to avoid me that badly?"
msgstr "*suspira* ¿Así que ahora usas otro nombre? ¿Tanto \\r\nquieres evitarme?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Chigusa"
msgid "Well, I've had enough of the lies! I've heard them all\\r\nbefore. First it's business out of the country, then you\\r\nneed money for an \"accident\"... It just never ends!"
msgstr "¡Bueno, me cansé de tus mentiras! Ya las conozco todas.\\r \nPrimero es porque tienes trabajo en otro país, después\\r \nnecesitas dinero por un \"accidente\"... ¡no se acaba nunca!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "476_Kiryu"
msgid "I'm telling you, you've got the wrong guy."
msgstr "Te repito que te equivocaste de hombre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Chigusa"
msgid "Fine! If you're really gonna keep playing dumb, I'll just\\r\nhave to refresh your memory."
msgstr "¡Está bien! Si vas a seguir haciéndote el ignorante,\\r \ntendré que refrescar tu memoria."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Chigusa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "500_Chigusa"
msgid "Well? Let's go!"
msgstr "¿Y? ¡Vamos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "512_Kiryu"
msgid "(She wants me to come with her? I really have no idea what she's talking about, though...)"
msgstr "(¿Quiere que la siga? No tengo ni idea de lo que habla...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "524_Chigusa"
msgid "Come on, the clock's ticking! I can make you remember me,\\r\njust you watch!"
msgstr "¡Vamos, no tengo todo el día! ¡Voy a hacer que te acuerdes de\\r \nmi, vas a ver!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Take a Rain Check
msgctxt "536_Kiryu"
msgid "I need you to listen to me. Whoever you're looking for, I'm not him."
msgstr "Necesito que me escuches. No soy a quien estás buscando."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "548_Chigusa"
msgid "No, I need <Italic>you</Italic> to listen to <Italic>me</Italic>! I can make you remember who\\r\nI am if you just come with me."
msgstr "No, yo necesito que <Italic>tú</Italic> me escuches a <Italic>mí</Italic>! Puedo hacer que te\\r \nacuerdes de mí si vienes conmigo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Take a Rain Check
msgctxt "560_Kiryu"
msgid "You just don't give up, do you?"
msgstr "De verdad que no te rindes, ¿eh?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "572_Chigusa"
msgid "Ugh, fine! I'll just wait here until you've come to your\\r\nsenses. Crawl back to me once you're ready to face the\\r\nmusic."
msgstr "¡Ugh, está bien! Esperaré aquí hasta que entres en razón.\\r \nVuelve a rastras hasta aquí cuando estés listo para \\r \nenfrentarte a la dura realidad."

